      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a great start. i want to lean into that \"ideological fire\" idea. can you expand on that? specifically, make it sound like the socioeconomic stuff was just an excuse or a symptom, but the real catalyst was his specific intellect and how he shaped the destiny of france. like, make it feel like if he hadn't been there, the revolution would have just fizzled out or been something totally different and meaningless.",
